WEBVTT

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.950
Whew, I thought I was going to die!

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.890
This land is indestructible!

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:35.460
And I'm going to kill you!

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:15.830
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:15.830
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:23.340
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:23.340
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:32.450
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:32.450
With our eyes on the future

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:38.550
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:38.550
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:48.190
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:48.190
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:55.700
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:55.700
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:01.410
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:01.410
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:10.920
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:10.920
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.830
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:28.770
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.200
Legends that have been gathered...

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.240
A duel of ambition and honor...

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.680
His drifting self,

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.580
and his remaining hometown,

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:42.210
are all tools to be used in the fight.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:47.920
Why are you here? Why? For whose sake?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.900
And what of the fate of our lost travelers?

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:11.520
Black Wind, you see now that
your Magun is useless!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.890
Why don't you be a good boy and come on out?

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:20.260
I might just save you if you agree
to serve His Excellency.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.960
Well? How about it? Come on, how about it?

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.630
Let's get out of here!

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:27.660
We can't do that!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.610
I have a feeling that we must stay close by!

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:34.270
I have a feeling that it's important
we watch this fight!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.310
You guys go someplace safe.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:41.480
Okay? You can't stay here.
Get as far away as possible.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.510
Do you understand?

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:49.620
Lisa!

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.590
Lisa!

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.070
<i>Where is he?</i>

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.530
Watch out, Chobi!

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:54.950
Oh, so that's where you've been?

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.900
Ai! Yu!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:06.830
<i>It's not moving.</i>

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.760
What's wrong now?

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.300
Stop it!

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:17.970
The kids are up there!

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:24.890
I guess you have not given up on opposing me.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:33.150
It does nothing. This isn't doing anything at all.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:39.860
This place is my life, the birthplace of my soul!

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:43.960
No matter how much you struggle,
you don't stand a chance!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.700
I will now make you a prisoner
of my deep world!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.080
All right!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.780
Hughug that Magun baby!

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:10.560
I suppose that's about what you'd expect.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.770
We can always count on Lord Fungus.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.640
Excuse me.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:28.470
Makenshi, one of the Five Lords of
Gaudium, where are you off to?

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.840
In search of Omega.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.950
Oscha, bring me some more bucket juice!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.320
I'll bring it right out, Your Excellency.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.340
<i>The air is filled with spores. I can't breathe.</i>

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:10.360
Kaze, we've got to get back to the kids.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:14.050
Please, will you come with me?

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.750
They were just caught up in your fight!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.760
You should have a reason to help them.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.110
Are you listening to me?

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:50.020
Why won't you say anything?!

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.970
Why do you just break everything?!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.800
What the hell are you?!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.210
It's calling me.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:11.380
The battlefield...

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.270
This mist is much like a cloud.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:48.480
You never should have awoken,

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.820
for your own sake.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.890
White Cloud...

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.890
Impressive as ever, Black Wind.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.230
Why won't you use the Magun?

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.110
Just as I thought.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:17.980
In that fight, your Magun was...

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:23.720
That's why you can't fire the Magun
at will now, can you?

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:30.290
How pitiful!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.530
You really don't get it?

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.270
If you stay here long enough,

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:41.800
the spores will eat into you and you
will no longer be able to move.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:45.850
So before that, Black Wind...

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.810
This is all for your sake.

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:59.550
Now sleep to the prelude of brightness
played by the Mist.

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:03.360
Prelude of the White Heat!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.990
What's with you?!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:36.690
Why are you always messing with us?!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:41.100
Sis, I think it'd be better if you didn't upset him.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.770
If I don't say what I want, I won't be
able to control my anger!

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:50.110
You will be executed in front of His Excellency!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.120
Why are you doing this?

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:59.080
I must get rid of all those who
threaten order in Wonderland.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.890
What do you mean, order?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:04.590
Are you saying that Wonderland
belongs to you guys?!

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.320
That's right!

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:12.430
Wonderland will continue consuming all the
Outside Worlds and growing infinitely larger.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:15.330
A world that will bring about a brand new order.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:21.840
Before long, His Excellency, the Earl,
will sit in God's seat and rule everything.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.810
Chaos is order.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.750
"God's Egg," so to speak.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.750
Did you get that?

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.340
I don't know.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:36.610
I don't expect it to make sense
to you filthy outsiders!

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:42.020
Before long, your home world will be
consumed by Wonderland.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:47.970
Just as this garden of mine was once
a part of my home world.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.200
A part?

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:57.280
My world has the power of eternal regeneration.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:02.070
Death does not exist to us!

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:06.880
We were a world that we thought
could never be destroyed,

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.980
but one day...

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:15.660
No! Now the time for that world
to be revived will soon come!

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:19.970
And then someday...

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:23.990
The day will come when I control Wonderland.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.200
Mist?! Is that Makenshi!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.170
Who is Makenshi?

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.980
Is that the guy who came to
attack the Comodeen?

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.390
Why have you come, Makenshi?!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.620
This guy is...

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.100
Makenshi?!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.570
The Black Wind is still alive.

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.740
What?! So he has yet to be devoured?

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.540
I'll leave to you the privilege of killing him off.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:08.880
Of course!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.950
Super Solidification!

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.460
Hey, don't enlarge yourself in here!

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.650
He's gonna crush us!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:32.930
Black Wind, where are you?!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.240
I'm hungry.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.670
Come out here!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:04.930
I have found you, Black Wind!

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:09.900
Your opponent is not Makenshi, but me!

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:14.410
Shall I smash these kids flat right now?!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.520
Ai! Yu!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.420
Lisa!

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:20.990
Stop this!

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:23.120
Those kids have nothing to do with this!

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:39.440
I'll smash them with my bare hands.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:58.420
What?! What's going on?! Why?

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:01.520
Why is everything crumbling?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.760
Is it mold?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.270
My land has been infected by mold!

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.170
This is just the same as the day
our world was destroyed!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:15.400
Is that same nightmare coming
back to haunt me?!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:20.440
Mold? A different kind of mold that
eats the mushrooms here?

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.150
What are we going to do?!

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.350
This thing is going to crumble too!

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.310
This is a nightmare!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.220
A nightmare!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.790
Nightmare...

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.890
The day my world was destroyed...

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.880
So the same happened to you.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.190
Ai! Yu!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.090
Lisa!

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.100
It has moved.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.940
Since it has come to this...

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.410
Black Wind!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:34.450
I will use all of my power to take you with me!

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.960
Soil is my power!

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:06.510
The Magun has thawed!

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:15.020
Your nightmare will soon end.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.460
Shut up!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.970
Why, you!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:26.170
My... My body...

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.710
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:36.080
The roar of the sky being destroyed,
Horizon Gold!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:46.780
A horrible rain of anger,
Arrow Black!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:55.500
And finally, the light that drives a wedge
in eternity, Photo Silver!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:10.240
Destroy! I summon you, Meteor Master!

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.900
What?!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.070
Unbelievable!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:04.200
This power...

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.910
Black Wind...

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.700
I had a feeling you were...

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:11.730
Unlimited...

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:17.610
To have you as my last opponent
was truly an honor.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.380
<i>Finally...</i>

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.250
<i>I can finally die...</i>

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.650
Oh, I'm so full!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:52.550
Fungus baby was such a dummy.

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.320
He was...

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.450
naive to a fault!

00:19:57.990 --> 00:20:00.020
Oscha, how's Chaos doing?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.990
He is perfectly satisfied.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.770
Well, for Fungus at least,

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.700
I think he did a good job.

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:23.440
Lisa...

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.450
Thank you.

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:33.780
I glad you're safe. I'm so glad...

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.490
What about Kaze?

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:44.030
<i>Kaze... That man...</i>

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
It's just like torture

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
I can't take it

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Douka kamisama

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Please, God

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
You are now the only person

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
That my eyes can see

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.000
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.000
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.140
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.140
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:57.110
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:57.110
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.910
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.910
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.280
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.280
On the inside

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:05.250
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:05.250
Something is going to start

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.990
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.990
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.090
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.090
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:13.460
All right!

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:13.460
All right!

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:18.920
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.460
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:28.370
The strongest enemy of the lost travelers...

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:31.770
Makenshi, who sees the true shape of Chaos...

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:35.420
Time will now start to move in great strides.

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:43.350
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
